  §5      Spyglass!
§6╚════════.✵.═╝
§8The Spyglass Tavern has been around as long as I have. Which is a very long time since witches’ are immortal at this point. With us being so powerful and all... There are not many of us left but I like to keep the legacy alive, 
#- §8even though I’m now just a humble bartender, shopkeeper and part-time magazine writer making an honest living here in Craftadia. 

§7§oWhy is it called The Spyglass? 

I hear nobody asking...

#- §8I was part of a witch §5cult §8a long time ago that went by the exact name! §nThe Order Of The Spyglass!§0 
§8Oh, the memories of adventure, thrills, spills, drama and saving the world… I’d love to tell you, but alas, I am limited as to what information I can divulge. What I can 
tell you about
#- §8The Spyglass is how it functions now. My tavern is my pride and joy. Serving only the best quality mushroom stew and infamous ‘Bert Beer’, the #1 choice for pirates everywhere! Located in a lush cave on a hillside valley, built from the ground up with my own bare hands (§7§oand a little bit 
#- §7§oof magic§0§8), the tavern is warm, welcoming and ready to shelter wandering travellers from the 
rain and cold. 
§7☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠
§8The piano is stuck looping ‘§ospooky scary skeletons'§r §0§8with no bard in sight but at least the song is somewhat pleasant...
§7☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠☠
#- §8Being a nature witch (§7§o§(that’s a witch made from nature for those who don’t have witchipedia§0§8), the downside is nature always takes over my tavern causing the odd cave to collapse and overgrown areas. Fun fact: I was created the same way Fern was, how cool is that?! I know right!!! 
#- §8Other interesting features of The Spyglass include; a younger version of myself working behind the bar§o (long story), §0§8the goddess Calypso captured in the form of an axolotl§o (another long story), §o§0§8a goat that saw §5ɨȶ §8and now won’t stop screaming, surprise Endermen attacks, the magazine
#- §8office that is boring and completely fine with nothing wrong whatsoever, the library that doesn’t exist§o (a very long story) §0§8and just all-round family-friendly fun §o§7§o(as long as you don’t disappear into the void or drink from my cauldron by accident like my sheep did and
#- §7§§§obecome a rainbow). §0§8The more exciting news is I’m making a second tavern, not at all sinister, at an undisclosed location, so be on the lookout for when that finally opens! Ps: yes I used the article section to do some shameless promotion so... 

§5 visit /warp spyglass
#- 
