§6└───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┘
§cCraftadia needed a tourist attraction. Somewhere to go and be entertained and have an ‘experience’. Well,/warp zoo has you covered! This zoo has multiple exhibits featuring all the wonderful wildlife of Craftadia. 
#- §cThe babies are adorable! Even a member of my family (§oa fellow witch, my third cousin twice removed§0§c) managed to get a job at the cafeteria. Still as grumpy as ever.

As you walk through each exhibit each animal has its unique habitat and fun facts to read. So cool! 
#- §cThe attention to detail is exquisite. You will also find special animals like rainbow sheep, one of my personal favourites. I got one at home. I think something may have gone wrong at the Iron Golem exhibit because it makes my brain hurt (§5hₐHₐ ɨȶ mₐKₑS hₑᵣ bᵣₐᵢn hᵤᵣT, tHₐt'S tᵣᵤₑ§c).
#- §cExhibit 4 takes a turn but it’s fascinating 
(§5ᵢ ₐm thₐNk yₒᵤ§c) with so many viewing points. 

Outside over the bridge is beautiful with it's own free panda feeding area (§5ᵢ dₒn't hₐᵥₑ ₐnytHᵢng fₒᵣ thₐt ₒnₑ§c). You can even ride the horses for free!

§6ɨȶ... stop interupting! 
#- §cA little souvenir shop can be found outside as well with Zoo Tokens, Safari Binoculars and the best Strawberry Zoo Cake I’ve ever tasted.
(§5tHₑ ₒnly ₒnₑ 
yₒᵤ'ᵥₑ ₑᵥₑᵣ tₐStₑd...§c)
 
Overall a fantastic build, and a great place to take the family for a day trip.
#- §6┌───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┐
   §8 I give this warp:
      §6★★★★★ 5.0
└───   §c⋆⋅☆⋅⋆   §6───┘
   §cWell worth a visit!

